{{Wireless embedded system |brand=EnGenius |model=ECM355AP |revision= |series=AC1300 |fcc_date=12/13/2018 |manuf_country=Taiwan |is_manuf=No |manuf=Senao |manuf_model= |type=access point |fcc_id=A8J-ECM355AP |cpu1_brand=Qualcomm |cpu1_model=IPQ4019;IPQ4019, 0VV, NE7176AP, E071700; |cpu1_cspeed=716 |cpu1_cores=4 |fla1=128 |fla1_brand=Micron |fla1_model=MT29F1G08ABAEA |fla2=8 |fla2_brand=Winbond |fla2_model=W25Q64BVSIG |ram1=256 |ram1_brand=Micron |ram1_model=MT41K128M16JT-125 |wi1_chip1_brand=Qualcomm |wi1_chip1_model=IPQ4019;IPQ4019, 0VV, NE7176AP, E071700; |wi1_802dot11_protocols=an+ac |wi1_txchains=2 |wi1_rxchains=2 |wi1_sstreams=2 |wi2_chip1_brand=Qualcomm |wi2_chip1_model=IPQ4019;IPQ4019, 0VV, NE7176AP, E071700; |wi2_802dot11_protocols=bgn |wi2_txchains=2 |wi2_rxchains=2 |wi2_sstreams=2 |eth_cpu=true |eth_chip2_brand=Qualcomm Atheros |lan_speed=1G |lan_ports=1 |addl_chips=SimpleLink Ultra-Low Power Wireless MCU for Bluetooth LE;Texas Instruments;CC2640;CC2640, R2F, TI 7AI, AZFG G4;1; |802dot11_protocols=abgn+ac }} {{TagLine|AC1300 Indoor Ceiling Mount Managed Access Point}}
"ECM355AP-0.20 LFP" is silkscreened on the board in the FCC photos.
There appears to be an additional 1x1:1 radio on the board. :It is likely the same Qualcomm scanning radio on :the Mini PCIe card in the [[EnGenius ECM955AP]].
